{
 "_comment": [
  "The kext inventory of the iOS 16.5 (20F66) kernelcache, taken from the",
  "donor this board prelinks against.",
  "",
  "How it was made:",
  "  1. the kernelcache out of the 16.5 image (IMG4 -> LZFSE -> arm64 slice),",
  "  2. the __PRELINK_INFO segment of that slice,",
  "  3. kits/XnuPrelink/native_prelink.py:unserialize_xml() on it.",
  "",
  "load is _PrelinkExecutableLoadAddr, size is _PrelinkExecutableSize.",
  "root marks the kexts that board.toml [kernel.prelink] roots names.",
  "All 30 roots are present in this kernelcache.",
  "",
  "The addresses are what sheng's display recipe hardcodes for the 17.7.11",
  "donor: every one of them has to be re-derived for this image, and the",
  "IOService::C2 / IOService::D2 stubs (142 pairs in __PLK_TEXT_EXEC) are",
  "the pattern to look for."
 ],
